/Health-Essentials?w=128&amp;q=75 1x, https://assets.clevelandclinic.org/transform/482db8cd-aa1e-45b5-a2a4-cf6aa5e5d2d4/Health-Essentials?w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="https://assets.clevelandclinic.org/transform/482db8cd-aa1e-45b5-a2a4-cf6aa5e5d2d4/Health-Essentials?w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="w-full"><h2 data-identity="headline" class="text-gray-900 font-bold leading-rem24px text-rem20px bp600:text-rem25px bp600:leading-rem30px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-bold pb-rem8px">Better health starts here</h2><p class="text-gray-900 text-rem16px leading-rem23px bp600:w-full pb-rem8px bp900:pb-rem16px">Sign up for our Health Essentials emails for expert guidance on nutrition, fitness, sleep, skin care and more.</p><div class="flex flex-col max-w-body gap-y-rem16px bp900:hidden"><a href="https://assets.clevelandclinic.org/transform/2ff943a2-abb1-4a1c-8ede-f8848703e789/HealthEssentials-SampleEmail-2026" target="_blank" class="font-medium text-brandBlue-500 hover:text-blue-800 text-rem15px leading-rem23px underline underline-offset-[5px]">Example email</a><a data-identity="link-button" class="transition select-none text-white bg-brandBlue-500 hover:bg-blue-800 group block font-medium text-rem18px leading-rem24px px-rem24px rounded-[0.3125rem] text-center focus-standard py-rem8px w-full bp600:w-fit" href="https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health-essentials-sign-up">Sign up</a></div><div class="hidden bp900:flex bp900:justify-between bp900:items-center w-full"><a data-identity="link-button" class="transition select-none text-white bg-brandBlue-500 hover:bg-blue-800 group block font-medium w-fit text-rem18px leading-rem24px px-rem24px rounded-[0.3125rem] text-center focus-standard py-rem8px" href="https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health-essentials-sign-up">Sign up</a><a href="https://assets.clevelandclinic.org/transform/2ff943a2-abb1-4a1c-8ede-f8848703e789/HealthEssentials-SampleEmail-2026" target="_blank" class="font-medium text-brandBlue-500 hover:text-blue-800 text-rem15px leading-rem23px underline underline-offset-[5px] whitespace-nowrap">Example email</a></div></div></div></div></div><section class="bg-blue-050 p-rem32px pb-rem8px mt-rem56px print:hidden"><h3 data-identity="headline" class="text-gray-900 font-bold leading-rem30px text-rem25px bp600:text-rem32px bp600:leading-rem38px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold mb-rem16px">Experts You Can Trust</h3><section data-identity="medical-review-disclaimer" class=""><span class="flex flex-col bp600:flex-row items-start text-gray-900 print:text-black" data-identity="medically-reviewed-badge"><span class="flex items-center"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="mr-rem4px"><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="7.5" fill="#ffffff"></circle><path d="M6.45 10.95L11.7375 5.6625L10.6875 4.6125L6.45 8.85L4.3125 6.7125L3.2625 7.7625L6.45 10.95ZM7.5 15C6.4625 15 5.4875 14.803 4.575 14.409C3.6625 14.0155 2.86875 13.4813 2.19375 12.8063C1.51875 12.1313 0.9845 11.3375 0.591 10.425C0.197 9.5125 0 8.5375 0 7.5C0 6.4625 0.197 5.4875 0.591 4.575C0.9845 3.6625 1.51875 2.86875 2.19375 2.19375C2.86875 1.51875 3.6625 0.98425 4.575 0.59025C5.4875 0.19675 6.4625 0 7.5 0C8.5375 0 9.5125 0.19675 10.425 0.59025C11.3375 0.98425 12.1313 1.51875 12.8063 2.19375C13.4813 2.86875 14.0155 3.6625 14.409 4.575C14.803 5.4875 15 6.4625 15 7.5C15 8.5375 14.803 9.5125 14.409 10.425C14.0155 11.3375 13.4813 12.1313 12.8063 12.8063C12.1313 13.4813 11.3375 14.0155 10.425 14.409C9.5125 14.803 8.5375 15 7.5 15Z" fill="#1b7638"></path></svg><span class="font-bold bp600:mr-rem4px">Medically Reviewed.</span></span><span class="font-normal">Last updated on <!-- -->08/21/2024<!-- -->.</span></span></section><p class="mt-2 mb-rem32px text-gray-900 text-base">Learn more about the <a href="https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline underline-offset-[5px] decoration-1 transition">Health Library</a> and our <a href="https://my.clevelandclinic.org/about/website/editorial-policy" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline underline-offset-[5px] decoration-1 transition">editorial process</a>.</p><div data-identity="headline-with-intro" class="mb-rem16px"><h3 data-identity="headline" class="text-gray-900 font-bold leading-rem30px text-rem25px bp600:text-rem32px bp600:leading-rem38px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold ">References</h3><p data-identity="intro-text" class="font-normal text-rem19px leading-rem32px text-gray-800 bp900:leading-rem34px max-w-body print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:mt-rem8px mt-rem16px">Cleveland Clinic’s health articles are based on evidence-backed information and review by medical professionals to ensure accuracy, reliability and up-to-date clinical standards.</p></div><section data-identity="collapsible-content-section" class=""><h4 data-identity="headline" class="text-blue-600 font-bold leading-rem24px text-rem20px bp600:text-rem25px bp600:leading-rem30px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-bold font-bold !leading-rem23px mb-rem24px !text-rem16px"><button class="group relative transition hover:text-blue-800 before:absolute before:inset-x-0 before:-inset-y-rem24px">View Sources<svg width="13" height="7" viewBox="0 0 13 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="inline-block ml-rem8px w-[12px] h-[11px] mt-[-1px] fill-brandBlue-500 group-hover:fill-blue-800 transition-transform-400 rotate-0 "><path d="M11.5826 2.43081L7.1992 6.51903C6.84941 6.84696 6.42309 7 6.00771 7V4.16885L10.1615 0.288318C10.6534 -0.170787 11.3749 -0.0724072 11.7684 0.517871C12.1619 1.10815 12.0745 1.96077 11.5826 2.41988V2.43081Z"></path><path d="M0.432964 2.43081L4.81633 6.51903C5.16612 6.84696 5.59243 7 6.00781 7V4.16885L1.854 0.288318C1.36211 -0.170787 0.640655 -0.0724072 0.247136 0.517871C-0.146383 1.10815 -0.0589339 1.96077 0.432964 2.41988V2.43081Z"></path></svg></button></h4></section></section><div class="hidden print:block mt-rem12px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal"><h3 data-identity="headline" class="text-gray-900 font-bold leading-rem30px text-rem25px bp600:text-rem32px bp600:leading-rem38px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold print:mb-rem8px">Experts You Can Trust</h3><section data-identity="medical-review-disclaimer" class=""><span class="flex flex-col bp600:flex-row items-start text-gray-900 print:text-black" data-identity="medically-reviewed-badge"><span class="flex items-center"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="mr-rem4px"><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="7.5" fill="#ffffff"></circle><path d="M6.45 10.95L11.7375 5.6625L10.6875 4.6125L6.45 8.85L4.3125 6.7125L3.2625 7.7625L6.45 10.95ZM7.5 15C6.4625 15 5.4875 14.803 4.575 14.409C3.6625 14.0155 2.86875 13.4813 2.19375 12.8063C1.51875 12.1313 0.9845 11.3375 0.591 10.425C0.197 9.5125 0 8.5375 0 7.5C0 6.4625 0.197 5.4875 0.591 4.575C0.9845 3.6625 1.51875 2.86875 2.19375 2.19375C2.86875 1.51875 3.6625 0.98425 4.575 0.59025C5.4875 0.19675 6.4625 0 7.5 0C8.5375 0 9.5125 0.19675 10.425 0.59025C11.3375 0.98425 12.1313 1.51875 12.8063 2.19375C13.4813 2.86875 14.0155 3.6625 14.409 4.575C14.803 5.4875 15 6.4625 15 7.5C15 8.5375 14.803 9.5125 14.409 10.425C14.0155 11.3375 13.4813 12.1313 12.8063 12.8063C12.1313 13.4813 11.3375 14.0155 10.425 14.409C9.5125 14.803 8.5375 15 7.5 15Z" fill="#1b7638"></path></svg><span class="font-bold bp600:mr-rem4px">Medically Reviewed.</span></span><span class="font-normal">Last updated on <!-- -->08/21/2024<!-- -->.</span></span></section><div data-identity="headline-with-intro" class="my-rem8px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold"><h3 data-identity="headline" class="text-gray-900 font-bold leading-rem30px text-rem25px bp600:text-rem32px bp600:leading-rem38px print:text-rem19px print:leading-rem27px print:font-semibold ">References</h3><p data-identity="intro-text" class="font-normal text-rem19px leading-rem32px text-gray-800 bp900:leading-rem34px max-w-body print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal print:mt-rem8px mt-rem16px">Cleveland Clinic’s health articles are based on evidence-backed information and review by medical professionals to ensure accuracy, reliability and up-to-date clinical standards.</p></div><div data-identity="rich-text" class=" after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:table"><ul data-identity="unordered-list" class="my-rem16px mx-0 pl-[1.25rem] list-disc marker:text-brandBlue-500 print:marker:text-black marker:pl-rem24px print:my-rem8px print:text-rem15px print:leading-rem20px print:font-normal  "><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Merck Manual, Consumer Version. <span class="break-words">Overview of Head Injuries<!-- --> <em>(<!-- -->https://www.merckmanuals.com/home/injuries-and-poisoning/head-injuries/overview-of-head-injuries<!-- -->)</em></span>. Last updated 3/2023. Accessed 8/16/2024.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">National Library of Medicine (U.S.). <span class="break-words">Head Injuries<!-- --> <em>(<!-- -->https://medlineplus.gov/headinjuries.html<!-- -->)</em></span>. Last updated 8/29/2016. Accessed 8/16/2024.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">National Library of Medicine (U.S.). <span class="break-words">Head Injury – First Aid<!-- --> <em>(<!-- -->https://medlineplus.gov/ency/article/000028.htm<!-- -->)</em></span>. Last updated 11/2/2023. Accessed 8/16/2024.</li><li class="mb-rem12px pl-rem12px text-gray-800 print:mb-rem4px text-rem15px leading-rem19px marker:text-rem19px print:text-rem13px print:leading-rem16px print:font-normal ">Shaikh F, Munakomi S, Waseem M. <span class="break-words">Head Trauma (Archived)<!-- --> <em>(<!-- -->https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK430854/<!-- -->)</em></span>. 2024 Feb 24. In: <em>StatPearls </em>[Internet]. Treasure Island (FL): StatPearls Publishing; 2024 Jan. Accessed 8/16/2024.</li></ul></div></div><div data-identity="social-share-links" class="mt-rem56px border-b pb-rem32px border-gray-400 print:hidden"><div class="gap-rem24px flex flex-wrap"><button data-identity="social-share-link-facebook" class="group w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-full bg-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-400 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="18" viewBox="0 0 10 18" fill="none" role="img" class="fill-gray-700 group-hover:fill-gray-800 max-w-[20px] max-h-[20px]" aria-label="Facebook"><path d="M6.3 10.35H8.55L9.45 6.75H6.3V4.95C6.3 4.023 6.3 3.15 8.1 3.15H9.45V0.126C9.1566 0.0873001 8.0487 0 6.8787 0C4.4352 0 2.7 1.4913 2.7 4.23V6.75H0V10.35H2.7V18H6.3V10.35Z"></path></svg></button><button data-identity="social-share-link-twitter" class="group w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-full bg-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-400 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="15" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" role="img" class="fill-gray-700 group-hover:fill-gray-800 max-w-[20px] max-h-[20px]" aria-label="X"><path d="M58.78,57.47l-20.96-30.45L61.05,0h-5.31l-4.55,5.27-15.74,18.32L20.46,1.8l-1.24-1.8H.8l4.49,6.53,19.93,28.96L.73,64h5.31l21.55-25.07,16.02,23.27,1.24,1.8h18.42l-4.49-6.53ZM47.04,59.83l-16.64-24.17-2.37-3.44L8.73,4.17h8.3l15.61,22.69,2.37,3.44,20.33,29.54h-8.3Z" class="fill-current"></path></svg></button><button data-identity="social-share-link-linkedin" class="group w-[40px] h-[40px] rounded-full bg-gray-300 hover:bg-gra